<title>USA: BEFORE THE BELL -- Kash n' Karry up on bid.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL -- Kash n' Karry up on bid.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kash n' Karry Food Stores Inc shares traded up 1-3/8 to 25-3/8 in Friday pre-open activity on the company's agreement to be acquired by Food Lion Inc for $26 per share in cash and debt assumption.</p>
<p>Food Lion's shares were untraded at 8-9/16.</p>
<p>The companies announced the deal last night.</p>
<p>Also, Sykes Enterprises Inc was actively traded ahead of the open, off 1/8 to 46-3/8.</p>
<p>In a secondary offering, the company is selling into the market 2.6 million new shares.</p>
<p>-- Brendan Intindola, Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1734.</p>
</text>
